:LearningPreference rdf:type owl:Class .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/abdel/ontologies/2023/0/modalia#LearningResourceType
:LearningResourceType rdf:type owl:Class .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/abdel/ontologies/2023/0/modalia#Lecture
:Lecture rdf:type owl:Class ;
