:QualityStandards rdf:type owl:Class .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/abdel/ontologies/2023/0/modalia#Question
:Question rdf:type owl:Class .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/abdel/ontologies/2023/0/modalia#Questionaire
:Questionaire rdf:type owl:Class ;
              rdfs:subClassOf :LearningResourceType .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/abdel/ontologies/2023/0/modalia#RDMResource
:RDMResource rdf:type owl:Class ;
             rdfs:subClassOf <https://github.com/tibonto/educor#EducationalResource> ;
             rdfs:comment "OER related to Reseearch Data Management"@en .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/abdel/ontologies/2023/0/modalia#RDMSkill
:RDMSkill rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf :Skill ;
          rdfs:comment "Research Data Managment Skill"@en ;
          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The ability to carry out tasks."@en .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/abdel/ontologies/2023/0/modalia#RDMTask
:RDMTask rdf:type owl:Class .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/abdel/ontologies/2023/0/modalia#RDMTool
:RDMTool rdf:type owl:Class ;
         owl:disjointWith :Skill ;
         rdfs:comment "Research Data Management tool to be made available via the platform"@en .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/abdel/ontologies/2023/0/modalia#Recommendation
:Recommendation rdf:type owl:Class .


