:Service rdf:type owl:Class ;
         rdfs:subClassOf :ProviderType .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/abdel/ontologies/2023/0/modalia#Skill
:Skill rdf:type owl:Class ;
       rdfs:comment "Job Skill, ability to perform some tasks."@en .


